 him down and  backing him into a wall until muzon was  forced to blow himself up scattering his  body into hundreds of pieces but even so  yurichi managed to destroy even these  fragments missing only a very small  portion of them but even this was enough  for muzon to regenerate from despite  making it out alive muzon would spend  the rest of yurichi's life hiding  himself away and began working from the  shadows and having other demons act in  his set to avoid putting his own life in  danger just in case another yurichi  would ever show up anyways muzon takes  on several different forms throughout  his life as a demon however it seems  like he does prefer his normal adult  male form as he always comes back to it  and anytime we see him in the past he is  always in this form this is the form  that we see him in when he first meets  tonjiro the king of pop form if you will  which looks like a 20 to 30 year old man  again we see him looking like this when  he first meets akaza when he first meets  kokushibo and when he battled with  yurichi in just about every flashback  any demons have of him and permanently  after the entertainment district arc  until he goes for a more large-scale  transformation it seems to be his go-to  form and as we see in each of his forms  muzon's body is always meant to make the  most of each situation that he finds  himself in to get the biggest benefit or  to hold the highest status the king of  pop form even sees him having a human  family which allows him to blend into  his environment and keep him from being  targeted by demon slayers as they say  the best place to hide is often in plain  sight we also see him taking this form  when visiting doki and it's hard to tell  if doki is just filled with adoration  for muzon in general or if she's  extremely attracted to him but one of  these is definitely true and while we do  see many demons sucking up to him  throughout the series it's typically out  of fear of being killed and rarely do w